  "bodyHash": "x61rXMHNvHs=",
  "content": "<h1>奧術統一化</h1><p>讓 Ars Nouveau 能夠使用其他模組的配方。</p><p>目前，本模組會收錄粉碎與切割類型的配方，並讓對應的符文能夠使用這些配方。</p><p>若存在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-glyphs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Not Enough Glyphs</a> 模組，\n其壓平符文也將獲得處理加壓類型配方的能力。</p><p>我<strong>不會</strong>添加多方位的配方擷取功能。</p><p>專為 Ars Nouveau 製作的配方永遠優先於其他模組的配方。</p><p>其他模組配方的優先級可在通用配置文件中調整。\n也可透過在配置文件中加入匹配的正則表達式來禁用特定配方被擷取。\n您可使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a> 獲取配方ID。</p><p>強烈建議搭配使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252falmost-unified\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Almost Unified</a>（非必需），\n它能減少功能重複的配方。</p><p>支援的模組：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252factually-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Actually Additions</a>（粉碎機）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenderio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ender IO</a>（SAG研磨機）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffarmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a>（切菜板）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersiveengineering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Engineering</a>（粉碎機、鋸木機）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fintegrated-dynamics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Dynamics</a>（榨汁機/機械榨汁機）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmekanism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a>（粉碎機、鋸木機）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodern-industrialization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modern Industrialization</a>（研磨機、切割機、壓縮機）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foccultism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Occultism</a>（粉碎靈魂）</li>\n</ul><p>標誌修改自 Ars Nouveau 的粉碎符文紋理，原始檔案可於<a href=\"https://github.com/baileyholl/Ars-Nouveau/blob/main/src/main/resources/assets/ars_nouveau/textures/item/crush.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>查看。</p>",
